# Recorded GitHub API responses (VCR/cassette style). No live network in CI.
#
# Layout:
#   github/orgs/<org-slug>/repos/<repo>/pulls/<number>.json
#   github/orgs/<org-slug>/repos/<repo>/commits/<sha>.json
#   github/orgs/<org-slug>/members.json
#
# Each file is a raw API response body. Tests replay these via the ingest layer.
